&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;npm:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/amazon-store" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;npmjs.com/package/amazon-store&lt;/a&gt;
